rooms_desc ({"This is the Entryhall of Jackos house.Your first impression is that this house is a palace, butyou don't see a throne.There is a Pickture on the wall and a doll in the corner.","This is the working room of Jacko.You thought there is no throne in this house.But now you see that Jackos Chair is a Throne.You think you get crazy.There is an Muzmuz-Dartboard on the wall","This is the Chaos room of Jackos house.It's really chaotical, like it's name.There are many corpses on the ground.There is a corpse.","This is the kitchen of Jackos house.You can't see anything useful.There is a bottle of blood on the ground.","This is the Playing room of Jackos house.A Pentium stands on a table.","This is the Summoning room of Jackos house.Jacko never tried to summon a monster, but a Pentagram looks goodin a room.","This is the room of pain.noone leaved this room alive.Exept Jacko.There is a Iron Maiden in the corner.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is the Bathroom of Jackos house.It's Quite large.",0,})
rooms_short ({"This is the Entryhall of Jackos house.","Working room of Jacko.","Chaos room.","Kitchen of Jackos house","Playing room.","This is the summoning room of Jackos house.","Room of pain","A brand new room, ready to be decorated","Bathroom of Jackos House",0,})
